      ],
      "source": "https://www.calaverashistory.org/douglas-flat",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Today Douglas Flat remains a quiet rural enclave sustained by ranching and farming, with landmarks like the enduring Malespina stone store.",
